==Rules==
* 10 min map with 3 min overtime
* All rounds are {{abbr|BO5|Best of 5}}
* Ruleset: smackdown / qcon / thunderdome
* Allowed only russian speak players
* A team that has lost with {{abbr|WO|Walk Over}} in WB will automatically lose with WO in LB too.
